@startuml
title D-10 Management Dashboard Source-of-Truth Boundary
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 220

actor "Executive / Manager" as Exec
actor "Finance / Revenue Assurance" as Finance
actor "Compliance Auditor" as Auditor
actor "Technical Operations" as Tech

component "Management Dashboard and Reporting\nvisibility / reporting / export only" as Dashboard

rectangle "Operational Visibility Sources" {
  component "Projection and freshness labels" as Projection
  component "Connector and Vendor PMS health" as ConnectorHealth
  component "Terminal and gate health" as DeviceHealth
  component "Continuity state visibility" as Continuity
}

rectangle "Canonical Financial / Fiscal / Audit Sources" {
  component "Central PMS payment and finality records" as Payment
  component "Payment provider outcome evidence" as Provider
  component "Site POS Server fiscal records" as Fiscal
  component "Central PMS fiscal references" as FiscalRef
  component "Reconciliation records" as Recon
  component "Audit and evidence access records" as Audit
}

Exec --> Dashboard : executive summaries
Finance --> Dashboard : revenue / settlement views
Auditor --> Dashboard : compliance / audit views
Tech --> Dashboard : health / exception views

Projection --> Dashboard : operational labels
ConnectorHealth --> Dashboard : health status
DeviceHealth --> Dashboard : device status
Continuity --> Dashboard : degraded state
Payment --> Dashboard : financial source
Provider --> Dashboard : provider evidence
Fiscal --> Dashboard : fiscal source
FiscalRef --> Dashboard : platform linkage
Recon --> Dashboard : reconciliation status
Audit --> Dashboard : access / evidence audit

note bottom of Projection
Operational visibility is not financial truth.
end note

note bottom of Fiscal
Fiscal truth originates from Site POS Server.
Dashboard does not issue or mutate fiscal records.
end note

note right of Dashboard
Exports require scope, RBAC, privacy controls,
source labels, freshness labels, and audit.
end note
@enduml
